#!   DESCRIPTION="&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose &amp;amp; Objectives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This workspace displays a model of the FME Lizard mascot in the FME Realize app. The FME Lizard also has a summary annotation created when the user points at the model in the app.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Transformer&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;AttributeCreator: Creates a summary annotation on the FME Lizard feature.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Source(s) - Reader Feature Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;OBJ Reader reads in the FME Lizard 3D model as a .obj file&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Output - Writer Feature Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;FME AR Writer saves the geometry into a form that is overlaid on a live view in AR&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;To customize this workspace, you can change the following:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Attributes to display in AR as summary annotations with the AttributeCreator transformer&#10;3D model of the FME Lizard with your own model&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;If you&apos;re recreating this workspace with your own data, it is recommended to build the workspace from scratch as your dataset will have different attributes and schema (structure).&lt;/p&gt;"
